## Notes

- Typed attributes are `snake_case`. Free-form attributes take Grafana JSON keys verbatim:

| Block | Free-form attributes |
| --- | --- |
| panel | `datasource`, `targets`, `options`, `field_config`, `transformations`, `links`, `library_panel` |
| variable | `datasource`, `query`, `current`, `options` |
| annotation | `datasource`, `target`, `filter` |
| row | `datasource` |
| dashboard | `time_picker` |

- `extra` (every block): keys merged verbatim into the JSON; must not repeat a set argument.
- `grid_pos`, `id` optional: panels auto-flow 12x8 on a 24-column grid; `grid_pos = { w, h }` sizes, adding `x`, `y` pins.
- `row` blocks hold their panels; `collapsed = true` nests them.
- `schema_version` defaults to 41.
- `overwrite` applies to create only; `uid` changes force replacement.

